## MONITORING TEMPLATES

- Create one template per device role: `Template-Windows-Workstation`, `Template-Windows-Server`, `Template-Mac-Workstation`, `Template-Linux-Server`
- Templates define: 24x7 checks, DSC, Automated Tasks, patch policy, MAV policy
- Apply at install time (wizard) — bulk reassign via All Devices view if missed
- Document template versions in Confluence with change records

### Recommended check thresholds (starting point — tune per environment)
| Check | Warning | Critical |
|---|---|---|
| CPU | 80% | 95% |
| Memory | 85% | 95% |
| Disk free | 15% | 5% |
| AV defs age | 2 days | 4 days |

---

## ALERTING

- Single destination preferred — route to Slack, not multiple targets simultaneously
- Escalation: warning → notify; critical → notify + open ticket (Jira via webhook or MSP Manager)
- Use Alert Suppression for maintenance windows

---

## NETWORK REQUIREMENTS

Before deploying to a new network segment, verify outbound HTTPS (443) to:
- Territory URL (e.g. `dashboard.systemmonitor.us` / `.eu`)
- `agent.systemmonitor.us` (or regional equivalent)

Full list: https://documentation.n-able.com/remote-management/userguide/Content/network_connection_reqs.htm

---

## SECURITY

- Use **Agent Key** for automated installs — do not embed staff credentials in packages
- Field techs: site-level permissions only, not global admin
- Regenerate packages when credentials rotate
- macOS: enforce FDA + Accessibility via MDM profile, not manual user action
- Audit periodically: User Audit Report → catch orphaned/duplicate device entries

---

## COMMON ERRORS

| Symptom | Cause | Fix |
|---|---|---|
| Agent missing from dashboard | Firewall blocking outbound 443 | Verify connectivity to territory URL |
| Duplicate device entry | Cloned after agent install | Remove duplicate, reinstall on clone |
| macOS agent inactive | Missing FDA / Accessibility | Grant in System Settings → Privacy & Security |
| Linux agent offline post-update | TLS 1.0/1.1 still in use | Update TLS config, restart agent service |
| Script output missing in dashboard | Exit code in 1–999 range | Migrate to 0 / 1001 / 1002 per standards doc |
| Template not applied | Assigned after install | Reassign from All Devices view |

